Files copied from TypeTopology
------------------------------

The 81 files under TypeTopology/ are copies of files from TypeTopology, by
Martín Escardó and contributors:

  https://github.com/martinescardo/TypeTopology
  commit 677877ee0a3b0f587023fcb20936a64eecde7b8b (18 August 2026)

TypeTopology is licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3.

The copies were modified on 8 October 2026, in these ways only:

  * every module name is prefixed with SPT.Cubical.TypeTopology, in module
    headers, in imports, and where prose mentions a module name;
  * --cubical-compatible is added to the OPTIONS pragma of every file that
    did not already have it;
  * a second OPTIONS pragma, -WnoUnsupportedIndexedMatch, is added to the
    nine files for which Agda reports that warning: MGS/Solved-Exercises,
    MLTT/Plus-Properties, MLTT/Two-Properties, UF/Embeddings, UF/Equiv,
    UF/EquivalenceExamples, UF/ImageAndSurjection, UF/PairFun and
    UF/Subsingletons;
  * a few import lines that became too long after the renaming are split
    over two lines.

No definition or proof was changed.  The authorship notices in the files
are unchanged.
